direction: down
title: "C23 cleanup ingress: request, nested drain and storage custody"
"Stable host authority" -> "Close request": "stop fresh ingress; keep current scopes and their roots"
"Admitted parent" -> "Child grant": "reserve before close; no late unbounded new work"
"Child grant" -> "Nested callback": "consume exact grant; return or retained unknown"
"Nested callback" -> "Known cleanup landing": "end_sfun and marker/root duties before parent settlement"
"Close request" -> "Deferred coordinator": "never synchronously wait for requesting callback itself"
"Known cleanup landing" -> "Ingress drain": "children and unused grants settled; guard only once"
"Ingress drain" -> "Collective and worker join": "physical drain and termination remain independent"
"Tcl result owner" -> "Storage closure": "release callback / origin holds can outlive execution"
"Collective and worker join" -> "Retirement receipt": "also require storage closure; unknown retains custody"
